  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.86,
      "end_seconds": 5.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "hi, doctor, I hope I'm not disturbing you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.58,
      "end_seconds": 11.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.49,
      "end_seconds": 20.58,
      "duration_seconds": 7.09,
      "text": "Yeah, it's throbbing headaches on one side. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.49,
      "end_seconds": 31.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.89,
      "end_seconds": 50.04,
      "duration_seconds": 16.15,
      "text": "around ten days... no wait, um, it's more like two days. I took the morning off to come in today. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.28,
      "end_seconds": 57.07,
      "duration_seconds": 6.79,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.99,
      "end_seconds": 78.21,
      "duration_seconds": 20.22,
      "text": "erm, mostly moderate. It's worse with bright light and skipping meals. It settles a little with a dark room. Oh, and zigzag lights before it starts. That's been about the same, about a week. With zigzag lights before it starts, it's severe, honestly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.87,
      "end_seconds": 98.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "A A few quick ones: head injury, stiff neck or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.95,
      "end_seconds": 102.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "No, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.27,
      "end_seconds": 107.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.91,
      "end_seconds": 109.83,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "text": "Skin's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.67,
      "end_seconds": 118.54,
      "duration_seconds": 7.87,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.08,
      "end_seconds": 121.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "I take paracetamol, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.31,
      "end_seconds": 127.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.13,
      "end_seconds": 133.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "1 gram, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.67,
      "end_seconds": 141.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.56,
      "end_seconds": 155.61,
      "duration_seconds": 13.05,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day. I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.3,
      "end_seconds": 173.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Okay, are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.41,
      "end_seconds": 176.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "My grandfather had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.26,
      "end_seconds": 181.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.68,
      "end_seconds": 187.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Mm, no, I've always been fairly healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.72,
      "end_seconds": 208.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.52,
      "end_seconds": 212.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "not to my knowledge, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.44,
      "end_seconds": 216.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.79,
      "end_seconds": 218.49,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.21,
      "end_seconds": 222.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "tell me if that's sore"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.57,
      "end_seconds": 241.74,
      "duration_seconds": 7.17,
      "text": "your eye movements are normal and and there is no weakness in your arms or legs"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.87,
      "end_seconds": 275.56,
      "duration_seconds": 30.69,
      "text": "okay, that's enough for me. Let me tell you where I've got to. It fits best with migraine with aura. Let's get a headache diary, for migraine. I'll start you on sumatriptan, 50 milligrams, at onset, repeat once after two hours if needed, when needed. That's for migraine. Keep a headache diary and avoid skipping meals. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.18,
      "end_seconds": 283.54,
      "duration_seconds": 7.36,
      "text": "See me again in six weeks. What are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.62,
      "end_seconds": 297.84,
      "duration_seconds": 12.22,
      "text": "so, I take the sumatriptan, 50 milligrams, at onset, repeat once after two hours if needed and come back in six weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.74,
      "end_seconds": 304.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.42,
      "end_seconds": 308.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "good, thanks, I'll see you then"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.05,
      "end_seconds": 311.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "have a good day"
    }
  ]
